et":"https://corymbus.co.uk/mailinglist/","line":71},{"title":"Patreon","target":"https://www.patreon.com/corymbus","line":71},{"title":"a coffee on PayPal","target":"https://www.paypal.me/corymbus/3","line":71},{"title":"*The Musical Theory and Philosophy of Robert Fludd*","target":"https://doi.org/10.2307/750743.","line":75},{"title":"*The Case of Robert Fludd*","target":"https://thewollesen.files.wordpress.com/2018/03/diotallevi-corrected2.pdf","line":77},{"title":"Robert Fludd and His Images of The Divine","target":"https://publicdomainreview.org/essay/robert-fludd-and-his-images-of-the-divine/","line":79},{"title":"The Rosicrucian Enlightenment","target":"https://www.routledge.com/The-Rosicrucian-Enlightenment/Yates/p/book/9780415267694","line":82}],"metadata":{"title":"Inside The Temple Of Music","source":"https://corymbus.co.uk/2023/08/22/inside-the-temple-of-music/","author":["[[corymbus]]"],"published":"2023-08-22","created":"2026-04-19","description":"Shortly after arriving at Bearsted station in Kent, I found my way to a picturesque village green, bordered by Tudor houses and Oast kilns. Peeking over the roofs on the other side was the tower of Holy Cross Church. I’d taken two trains to get here under the assurance it would be open.  I headed…","date created":"Sunday, April 19th 2026, 10:24:50 pm","date modified":"Sunday, April 19th 2026, 10:25:51 pm"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"2023-08-22 - Inside The Temple Of Music.md"},
